  "description": "Full-duplex speech-to-speech composite for the Voxa pipeline (VRT-005). A SpeechToSpeechProcessor that slots in where the cloud realtime composites (OpenAI Realtime / Azure Voice Live) do — full-duplex, model-owned VAD/turn-taking, identical lifecycle/diagnostics frames — but driven by an in-process (or sidecar) ISpeechToSpeechSession instead of a wire transport. Ships the seam + composite; the local speech-to-speech model is deferred behind a feasibility spike.",
